WEBVTT

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.930
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:57.530
<i>Up above the forest of slumber</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:04.160
<i>Two moons look down from the sky</i>

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:11.670
<i>Where did you come from,</i>
<i>and where are you going?</i>

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:20.050
<i>Where are we going?</i>

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.730
<i>ENTER THE RED DOORS</i>

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:40.920
How about it, Doctor?
What is Jane's prognosis?

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.100
Would it be all right if I saw Jane's room?

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.180
Jane is kind of antisocial.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:52.730
This is important. Would you be so kind?

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:06.840
She loves fruit. Especially strawberries.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.390
I understand how you must feel, but...

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.860
Sometimes, it's gone later,

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.650
so I wonder if she secretly doesn't
get up in the middle of the night.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:18.900
I don't know about that...

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.020
Wouldn't it be fun if that were true?

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.680
I love a good mystery.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.730
Huh? Who are you?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.560
H-Haruto. N-Nice to meet you.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:08.400
Hmm? Haruto, huh?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.650
Pretty fancy name. Well, that's okay.
It's not your fault, right?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:24.030
I'm Jane Doe. People call me Jane.
Nice meeting you.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.020
N-Nice meeting you.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.770
Hey, why are you backing away?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.230
Oh, you know...

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.230
Yeah, why?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.210
Welcome, Haruto!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.420
I love a good mystery!
Come along, Haruto!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.010
Too cold!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.520
What's the matter, Haruto?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.040
Aw, well... I can't swim.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:17.020
Huh? Can't you do anything
about that? This is a dream.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.400
Water and I don't get along too well.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:23.970
Okay, I got it.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.700
There, you'll be okay like that.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.200
Wh-What is this?

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.000
Let's go.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.080
Well, whatever.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.330
This is a dream. Pull it together, Haruto!

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:25.840
"Dream Dimension α"

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:36.780
"Leave it to me," huh?
Where do I even begin?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.170
I guess I'll look for Haruto first.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:52.300
Hey, hold on, hold on,
hold on, hold on, hold on!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.410
Whoa, what are you doing?!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:56.730
Hey!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:06.030
Delightful!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.260
Huh? You're gone?

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.740
Where did you go?

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.660
That's pretty dangerous. What are you doing?

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.520
Are you okay?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:41.130
She disappeared? Did you do something?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.830
No, I didn't do anything.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.410
Professor K, up ahead!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.680
Are you okay, Professor?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.370
Ugh, this girl is a bit of a handful.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.520
She doesn't seem to like me.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.340
She <i>really</i> doesn't like me.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.970
No, in fact, I get the feeling that she <i>does</i>.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:15.650
White is so drab, after all.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.370
Lily!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.530
Big Brother, I'm here.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:25.340
It takes a girl to understand
a girl's feelings, you know.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.700
Isn't that right, Professor K?

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.000
Oh, yeah, the professor can't see me.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:34.190
Lily says she'll come with us.
What do you say?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.560
I'd like to ask her along, actually.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.270
I get the feeling that this dream
is of a somewhat different type.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:43.850
Ah, hold on, please don't do that.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:44.720
Here we go.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.050
Wait!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.910
Sure enough, that's the 
way this is unfolding.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:04.700
Lights!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:13.580
I'm going on ahead!

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.850
Big Brother, did you do something to Jane?

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:37.160
Professor K, what do we do now?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.790
We know where she is, so all
we can do is move forward. Besides...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:47.130
What's that sound?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.380
You really must have done
something to her, Big Brother.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.080
What's going on here?

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.070
Don't ask me.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.110
What are you mumbling about?

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.300
Jane's Spark?

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:52.850
What is that?

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.900
Hey, Big Brother, come on and dance!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.460
Jane, this is fantastic!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.900
It would be even better
if it wasn't a dream!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.780
Huh? Did she pass out?

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:57.530
What could have happened to those two?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.090
The professor left
before we were finished.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.120
Was it something <i>I</i> said?

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:15.580
I got it!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:22.960
So that's it...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.210
I can't lose!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:35.810
Go!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.690
Okay, you agreed.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.570
Well? Get any good shots?

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:10.260
His expression is a little stiff, huh?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.020
Big Brother is so serious, after all.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.460
Hey, can you do it like <i>this</i>?

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:21.950
Put some motion into it,
like you're enjoying yourself.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.630
Meow-meow.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.070
Meow-meow!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.660
How about if he did this pose?
This one is good, too.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.960
Ah, this one! How cute!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.080
We have similar tastes.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.630
Okay, let's shoot a whole bunch.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.470
Sure.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.650
Fight!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:48.850
Professor K...

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:55.020
I don't get all the complicated stuff,

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.100
but who knew that she was
doing something so amazing?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:00.080
Yes, it's really wonderful.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.050
I think it's great...

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:08.270
that there are such different ways of living.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.610
Big Brother, looking good!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.390
How are things going there?

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.970
Will you be able to bring
Jane back with you?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.910
Huh? You can see me, Professor?

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.520
Nothing is impossible to us.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.130
Are you sure you're okay sticking with this?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.930
Those two really go together, huh?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.430
He got her mad at him.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.770
That's because Haruto is so serious.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:01.600
You can't tackle someone
like her head on, you know.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.550
Huh? Then <i>you</i> get in there, Professor.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:11.260
Hmm... I'm a fan of Jane's, so...

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:12.950
Huh?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.420
Haruto, you're just like the others, huh?

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.520
Huh?

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:32.330
Come on, Jane. It's okay.
You don't have to be afraid.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.800
This is where I draw you close, Haruto.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:46.290
Jane, you can't stay in a dream
like this. Wake up, Jane.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.170
I know you can do it.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:54.520
Let's go, together with me.
Come on, summon your courage.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.370
What does a made-up world
like this have for you?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.120
Open your eyes and start walking, Jane.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.500
Don't give up, Jane!
I know you can do it, Jane!

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:13.010
Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane!
Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane! Jane!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.690
Aw, man!

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.900
Everyone's so annoying.

00:17:26.380 --> 00:17:28.450
Stop humoring me, will you?

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:32.900
I'll decide for myself what's best for me.

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:37.770
Ah-Ah-choo!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:40.000
Wh-What was that?!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.370
Sorry, my sneezes are...

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.970
I want to try that, too!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.620
How great is that?

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.690
Well, it's about time I went up
and asked her point-blank.

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.070
Right.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:20.820
I like cats, too.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.920
Yes, I can tell that by looking.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.170
Um, do you mind if I smoke?

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.720
Ah, of course, please, smoke away.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.680
I'll make myself more comfortable, as well.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.270
Oh, dear. Is the professor
all right in there?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.530
This is going about as well as
arranged marriage discussions.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:50.270
Right, Big Brother?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.760
Don't touch her things without asking!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.320
It's no use. I can't make
heads or tails of this.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.240
Why are you trying so hard to smoke?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:18.710
Ever since I was little, I've been frail,

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:23.010
and I always envied the other
children who played outside.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.560
I wanted to do all sorts of things,

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:28.530
but I couldn't do <i>this</i>, and I couldn't
do <i>that</i>--I couldn't do <i>anything</i>.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:32.890
One day, I became friends with a snake
who came to my hospital room.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:37.030
But before long, they found him...

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.260
...and told me to hurry
and get rid of that thing.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:47.780
"That thing"? It was an honest-to-goodness
snake, not "that thing."

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.790
In my dream, I thought that I could smoke.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:00.020
But I can't, huh?
Even in my dream, I cough.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:05.890
"I'm Home, Jane."
"Jane's Lollygags." "Jane's Spark."

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.240
I subscribe to them all, Jane.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.600
You are the one who writes
those blogs, aren't you?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:16.090
It's no wonder that I couldn't
tell who you were.

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.820
I never would have guessed you
write them inside your dream.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.660
I like the name Jane Doe.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:26.660
I doubt anyone would
typically dislike the name.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:30.830
"Average Joe"
"Jane Doe"

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.520
I like it. "Average Joe," too.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.330
Everyone knows the names, but no one
actually <i>knows</i> who they are.

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:39.490
It really is you, all right.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.130
Incidentally, could I ask you a question?

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:46.760
Sure, I don't mind.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:51.460
What was it that Haruto
said to you back there?

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.000
I'm not very good with words.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.310
Despite the fact that you
write such terrific blogs?

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:06.320
When someone is right
in front of me, I'm hopeless.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.560
I'm grateful to him.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.170
He gave me a chance.

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:21.130
Then that means I can see you on the outside?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.010
Um, will you be my friend?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:24.880
Of course.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.370
There's something else
that I'd like to ask first.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:40.900
How long has Haruto not been awake?

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.940
I'll need your help before long.

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:46.840
Okay.

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.760
Sleeping Beauty and thorns--
it almost sounds like a fairy tale.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.850
What thorns would put you to sleep?

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:36.300
Which, baa!

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:41.440
"The Thorn Cross Association"

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.470
Next time's dream is
"The Thorn Cross Association"
